Painlevé classification
The ODE (6) has two regular singularities (at s1, s2, both apparent) and one irregular singularity
of rank 1 (at x = ∞). This singularity configuration on P1 is precisely the setting of the Jimbo–
Miwa–Ueno isomonodromic deformation theory [5].
